  "name": "Multiple Unsub - Symantic",
  "description": "Recent malware campaigns observed by Symantec involved phishing emails containing code used to download various payloads, including Rhadamanthys, NetSupport, CleanUpLoader (Broomstick, Oyster), ModiLoader (DBatLoader), LokiBot, and Dunihi (H-Worm). Analysis of the scripts used to deliver malware in these attacks suggests they were generated using LLMs. Symantec",
